  "title": "Soup For Couscous",
  "description": "This garbanzo bean, sauteed vegetable and hard boiled egg stew seasoned with turmeric and coriander is a vegetarian delight meant to be served spooned over a mound of cooked couscous.",
  "authors": [
    "Tania Covo"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-01-12T18:44:19-05:00",
  "date_modified": "2022-07-14T18:16:35-04:00",
